WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:05.590
Good morning John. It’s Wednesday and uh
something about me has changed and it’s

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:10.830
not my clothes. That’s right I’m wearing
the same clothes I was yesterday, but different

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:11.830
hair.

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:15.080
And John this video is in honor of you because
you put this little meme up on your website

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.910
and I’m a big fan of those old Myspace memes
and I kinda wish they wouldn’t have gone

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:23.540
away. Sad that they’re gone. And so I’m
bringing the meme into Brotherhood 2.0 a little

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.779
bit here. Let’s call this meme for lack
of a better name: “Google Verb”. It works

00:00:26.779 --> 00:00:30.750
like this: You google your name with a verb.
And then you find out what you did. Here we

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:31.750
go!

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:32.750
Google Verb number 1:

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:37.420
Hank needs…
Hank needs… a hug. Aww. (hugs camera). Thanks

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.280
everybody for that giant Youtube hug.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:44.130
Hank looks like…
Hank looks like a pretty princess. Oddly enough

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:48.420
that one was actually about me. It was a title
of a video in reference to my World Wide Web

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:51.730
girl video. With the pigtales. Yeah.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.379
Hank says…
Hank says don’t rush to judgment; which

00:00:54.379 --> 00:00:55.399
is good advice.

00:00:55.399 --> 00:00:57.154
Hank wants…
Hank wants to play too, but he never gets

00:00:57.154 --> 00:00:59.050
to.

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:02.539
Hank does…
Hank does a dance! (dances)

00:01:02.539 --> 00:01:06.130
Hank hates…
Hank hates you all! No he doesn’t. He doesn’t.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:07.700
He doesn’t hate you all.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.319
Hank asks…
Hank asks what to do with the body and Mr.

00:01:10.319 --> 00:01:14.890
Bennett says for him to prepare it for shipping.
That’s scary.

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:17.810
Hank likes….
Hank likes to watch men pee on Flickr. I’m

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:19.689
starting to get a little bit upset about this.

00:01:19.689 --> 00:01:22.310
Hank eats…
Hank eats a glob of bacon grease and gets

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:27.170
deathly sick. I’m not making these up! I
hope Hank is not a person. I hope Hank is

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:28.170
a dog.

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:31.210
Hank wears...
Hank wears a golden helmet while rafting the

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:34.439
Zambezi river. Hank sounds like he’s having
a very good time!

00:01:34.439 --> 00:01:37.469
Hank was arrested for...
Hank was arrested for robbing the National

00:01:37.469 --> 00:01:39.880
Bank of Greece but later found innocent.

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.649
And finally,
Hank loves..

00:01:41.649 --> 00:01:46.179
Hank loves Smosh. Even though Smosh is spelled
wrong, apparently I still love Smosh which

00:01:46.179 --> 00:01:47.179
is true.

00:01:47.179 --> 00:01:50.829
You guys you crack me up. Anyway Hank’s
life sounds significantly more interesting

00:01:50.829 --> 00:01:54.709
than mine what with the rafting and the watching
people pee and so on.

00:01:54.709 --> 00:01:58.729
So all that's left now is for you to play
the Google Verb Meme too. All you have to

00:01:58.729 --> 00:02:02.210
do is do what I just did. All the questions
are in the sidebar and leave your video as

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:06.529
a reply to this one. I’m going to go ahead
and tag five people because I want them to

00:02:06.529 --> 00:02:10.250
do this because I think it would be funny.
I’m tagging Nerimon and I think you all

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:15.379
know why; Dr. Noise, Sistersalad, Short sisters,
and pilocrates.

00:02:15.379 --> 00:02:16.599
John I will see you later.

